                                "v1",
                                "catalogs",
                                "search"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "High-quality semantic search within a specific repository's catalog entries.\n\nUses advanced retrieval: processes multiple queries, dedupes by repository, and enriches results with full SQLite context."
